+  // 2026-08-02): a RATIO threshold (meanAmplitude * K) collapses to a
+  // single-column fake region whenever the quietest span's own amplitude is
+  // near-zero (genuine digital-silence pauses aren't perfectly flat — small
+  // in-pause fluctuations can exceed a tight ratio band even though every
+  // sample is still near-silent compared to real speech). The frozen
+  // absolute-delta formula (BOUNDARY_QUALITY_REGION_END_DELTA, +0.05) has no
+  // such degenerate case.
